"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>M</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> "
"<guimenu><accel>E</accel>dition</guimenu>"
"<guimenuitem>Envoyer un courrier.</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:292
msgid ""
"Does the same as <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> clicking on the "
"<guilabel>email:</guilabel> line at the bottom of the Business card."
msgstr ""
"Fait la même chose qu'un clique <mousebutton>droit</mousebutton>"
"sur la ligne <guilabel>email:</guilabel> dans le bas de la carte de visite."

#: index.docbook:292
msgid ""
"<shortcut> "
